<title>USA: NYS rating stable at A2 in current economy-Moody's.</title>
<headline>NYS rating stable at A2 in current economy-Moody's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York State's rating is &quot;stable in the current economic environment,&quot; Moody's Investors Service said Tuesday, adding it refined the rating to A2 from single-A as part of its reassessment process.</p>
<p>The rating refinement affects $4.7 billion of outstanding general obligations, Bob Kurtter, a Moody's analyst said, in prepared comments.</p>
